<mxCell id="x7" value="Six stages, read left to right. Inside a stage, the steps run top to bottom." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1269" width="691.5" height="32.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;PLAN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Turn a request into units of work that can run side by side.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1321.3" width="452" height="1433.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-foot" value="Not settled: how the plan is redone after a unit fails." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1380" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Understand the request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Say back what is wanted before any work starts.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The request arrives in the owner's words&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Session start: the board is loaded (rules, facts, next task)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Say it back, then act on the owner's go&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Derive from research and measurements; do not ask&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Check what is known&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Look it up before working it out.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ask memory first: solved or ruled on before?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Read the token usage and agree a cap before any fan-out&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;uses B2 Look up · B3 Library · B5 Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cut into units&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A unit is one job for one session, small enough for one context window.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cut the work into units&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Each unit declares: files it writes and reads, what it needs first, shared things, risk, model, size&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="748" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Order the units&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Find what can run together, and when it will finish.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Two graphs: needs (who waits for whom) and collisions (who writes the same place)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Waves: units with no unmet need and no collision start together&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Predicted finish, and the limit that will bind&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The plan as data: role, model, token limit and order, in a file the gate reads&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1105" width="400" height="261" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;ADMIT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Decide what starts now, and on which model.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="649.6" y="1321.3" width="452" height="1433.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-foot" value="Not settled: how to put a number on the value of a unit." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1380" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ready and fit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Only units whose needs are done and that fit every limit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ready queue: units whose needs are all done&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fit filter: a unit must fit every limit at once&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#b45309;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;uses D Limits&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pick the next unit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Which of the ready units goes first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;In a tight token window: most value per token&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Otherwise oldest first, with short units filling the gaps&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reservation: a slot and tokens held for the oldest unit that does not fit yet&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pick the model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The smallest model that gives the same output.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Haiku: locate things, extract into a fixed form&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sonnet: read, collect, run commands, build ordinary code&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opus: delicate code, analysis, refuting, coordinating&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fable: coordinating a tree that has sub-trees&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Effort before size: think harder before a bigger model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;see B4 Reasoning cache&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="748" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gate and start&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A script allows the start; the unit gets its own workspace.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Plan gate: refuses a start the plan does not allow&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Start: own copy of the repository, own branch, a one-page brief&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1105" width="400" height="261" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;WORK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;A tree of sessions. Each session has one purpose.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1219.2" y="1321.3" width="452" height="1433.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-foot" value="Not settled: split the tree or hand over when work grows; when an inner level pays." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1380" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The tree of sessions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Coordinators coordinate; workers work.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Root session: only coordinates; keeps the task table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Inner session: coordinates one part, where its summary is far shorter than the work&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Worker session: one unit, in its own copy (a worktree)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Helpers: short-lived, one lookup or one check; not a level of the tree&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Brief in, fixed form out&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;How sessions pass work without reading each other again.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The brief: one page with scope, pointers to files, what is settled, open items, done condition&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fixed return form, checked by script&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The worker's loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Look up, claim, write.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ask, do not read: the code map and memory before opening files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Claim: declare what will be written, down to the function&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Version-checked write: only if the place is unchanged since it was read&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;uses A3 Answer a question · B2 Look up&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="748" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Report and wake&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Results stay on disk; the parent reads a summary.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Results on disk: only path, hash and a short summary go up&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Claims file: every claim with the test that proves it&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;Done&amp;quot; is written last; the parent wakes, reads state again, starts the next unit&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1105" width="400" height="261" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;CHECK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Nothing lands unchecked.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1788.8" y="1321.3" width="452" height="1433.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-foot" value="Not settled: who runs the gate where hooks cannot; the rule for tests that fail at random." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1380" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Own tests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;While it works, a unit runs only its own tests.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own tests first&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full suite at the right time: before work is stacked on unchecked parts, and once at the end&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The shared check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The full suite has few slots, so it is queued and made cheaper.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A fair, visible queue; runs in a clean container&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Shorten the run: only the tests the change can affect&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Batch what waits; split the batch only if it fails&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Test ahead: assume the change in front passes&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Blind review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A fresh session tries to break the result.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Blind refuter: sees only the result&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coverage rule: every item comes back, is run again, or is waived in writing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Planted faults: measure how many each check really catches&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="748" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verdict&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A typed answer about one exact commit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Typed verdict: pass, fail or not run, naming the commit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Finding rule: closes only on a test that fails before the fix and passes after&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fix rounds: two at most; revert, do not patch; a fresh reviewer after two failures&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1105" width="400" height="261" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;LAND&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;One ordered merge at a time.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2358.4" y="1321.3" width="452" height="1433.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-foot" value="Not settled: wait or redo when two units hit one place. The literature gives no general answer." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1380" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Merge queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One script, one lock, one order.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;One order, one lock&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Verdict must match: only the exact commit that was judged is merged&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A human reads risky lines (money, access) before the merge&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Merge, then recheck&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The merged result is checked; a failure is undone.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The check runs on the merged result; on failure the merge is undone&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commit check: refuses a commit that edits records or evidence&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Two writers, one place&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Tried in this order when changes collide.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;1. Own copies: the floor&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;2. Reshape hot places into entries applied at landing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;3. Version-checked writes: read again and redo if it changed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;4. Claims below the file: lock a function, not a file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;5. Wait for a hot pair, if waiting costs less than redoing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;6. Structured merge, last&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="748" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;After the landing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The records follow the code.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Board rebuilt from each unit's state file, never edited by hand&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds A1 Build the code map&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1105" width="400" height="261" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;6&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;LEARN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Keep what this work taught.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2928" y="1321.3" width="452" height="1433.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-foot" value="Not settled: who marks a stored entry stale when the code under it changes." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1380" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Write back the numbers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Real measurements correct the next plan.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Real footprint and times of each unit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tokens per unit become the next plan's estimate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Correct the rates: predicted finish against real finish&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#be185d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds D Limits · G Measure and improve&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;File the knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Solved problems and findings go into memory.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A hard problem that was solved is filed in the knowledge store&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A finding, a ruling or a mistake becomes a library record with its evidence&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds B1 File a solved problem · B3 Library&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Harden into checks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A lesson that repeats becomes a test.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rule of three: seen three times, it becomes a lint rule, a test or a gate clause&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Promoted check: a proven trap becomes a test in the shared check&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="748" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prune and hand over&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Memory must stay true and must pay for itself.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Mark what went stale&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Write down misses&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Count every lookup: hits, misses, false leads&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stop rule: a store with fewer than 3 verified hits in 20 uses is retired&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hand over through files, not through a session's memory&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1105" width="400" height="261" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x8" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="2856.8" width="3352" height="1707" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x9" value="WHAT KEEPS IT IN BOUNDS" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="2882.8" width="820.5" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x10" value="Four pipelines that run beside the path: they check each step, limit how much runs, keep each session small, and bring failed work back." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="2954.3" width="1305.7" height="32.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#b91c1c;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;C&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;GUARDS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Scripts that check a step before it happens, and can refuse it. The model is not just asked to behave.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#fde2e2;swimlaneFillColor=#fde2e2;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="3006.5" width="3212" height="439.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-foot" value="Today: live in this repository, except the write guard and the audit. Not tested: whether the hooks fire inside helpers and in other folders." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="26" y="405" width="3160" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;At session start&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The rules are put in front of the session.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Start hook: loads the board, also after a compaction&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Before a helper starts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Right model, and allowed by the plan.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tier hook: refuses the wrong model for the kind of job&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Plan gate: refuses a start the plan does not allow&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Before a write&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Records stay intact; a unit stays in its own files.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Record guard: no edits to evidence or journal lines; no design questions to the owner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Write guard: no write outside the files the unit declared&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;For a heavy command&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Heavy work waits its turn.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The lane: a queue with a few slots, low priority, a time limit&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;At commit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The same rules once more.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commit check: also catches writes made through the shell&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Afterwards&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;What really happened is read back.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Transcript audit: which model each helper really ran on, and what it read&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="2326" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trust base&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;What the guards themselves rest on.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Least privilege: each role gets only its tools and folders&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Trusted checker: only a small script promotes a claim to a fact&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sealed ledger: each line carries the hash of the line before&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Self-test and canary: a planted violation must be caught&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="2786" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;D&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;LIMITS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;How many units run at once: as many as the tightest limit allows.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ffecc9;swimlaneFillColor=#ffecc9;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="3530.3" width="1372" height="527.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-foot" value="A hypothesis built from the literature. Its numbers wait for measurements Q01 to Q37. Not known: how tokens that are read again count against the allowance." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="26" y="493" width="1320" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Measure each limit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One number per scarce thing.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b45309;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Memory: a hard floor; below it nothing starts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Processor: cores busy against cores present&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The shared check: slots × (check time + work time) / check time&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ready work: more workers than ready units helps nothing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Token windows: one refills every 5 hours, one every week; fit both&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The parent's window: too many children overflow it&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="363" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Width = the smallest&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Run as many as the tightest limit allows, and name that limit.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="363" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pace the tokens&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Spend the allowance without running dry.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b45309;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Token governor: one budget per window; learns the window's size from limit messages&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reserve: for running units, and for the owner's own use&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Spend the rest at once, while work is waiting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A unit's own cap: measured need plus a buffer; then save state and hand on&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A dearer model only where its value beats its share of the window&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 2 ADMIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="363" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#475569;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;E&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;CONTEXT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Keep every session's window small, because every call reads all of it again.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e2e8f0;swimlaneFillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1548" y="3530.3" width="1832" height="527.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-foot" value="Measured over 7.35 billion tokens in two projects. The split rule is approved for one trial at 300,000 tokens; not run yet. Not settled: whether a brief loses less than a summary." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="26" y="493" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Where the tokens go&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Measured over 35,800 model calls.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reading again is 96.8 % of all tokens: use = calls × window size&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A window holds: fixed prefix 27 %, own earlier output 26 %, fetched content 26 %, old summaries 8 %&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The long coordinator is the main sink: 333,000 to 396,000 tokens per call&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;65 % of a session's re-read tokens sit past 300,000&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Not the problem: model mix, file reads, human prompts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;After a compaction: mistakes rise from 0.58 to 1.35 per 100 calls, then fade&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="363" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Keep the window small&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Six levers.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cap the coordinator: hand over at 150,000 to 200,000 tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strip the helper prefix: about 60,000 tokens of unused tool descriptions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Batch lookups: one call for several reads&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Keep own output on disk, not in the window&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fewer parent wakes: children report in batches&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Scripts before agents&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="363" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Watch and split&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A full session becomes two.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fill gauge: a script reads the fill at every step&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The line: at 300,000 take nothing new, finish, commit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Split by scope: two children, each with a brief&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Or roll over: one successor continues from files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;Taken&amp;quot;: each child confirms its brief against the repository&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Merge small siblings&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="363" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backstops&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;If the split does not happen in time.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Caps on the tree: 3 children, 3 levels&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hard ceiling: past the line plus 10 points, only the hand-over is written&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Compaction: the app summarises the window&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Kept tail: the last messages word for word, beside the summary and the git status&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hand-over check: a reader compares it with the real state&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cheapest hand-over point: a square-root law&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="363" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;F&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;RECOVERY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Sessions and machines fail. The work must survive.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#d5f2ee;swimlaneFillColor=#d5f2ee;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="4142" width="2292" height="395.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-foot" value="Today: scripts built, 965 tests pass; never run on a real tree. 13 fixes designed, none built. Not solved: keeping the PC on while the owner is away." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="26" y="361" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Keep state on disk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Nothing important lives only inside a session.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Task table: units, attempts, states&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commit record: a result exists once its record is written; the first record wins&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Checkpoint: a session near its cap saves its state&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="231" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Watch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A script outside the session judges progress, not just liveness.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Watcher: reads, decides, exits&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stall: calls but no progress. Hang: no calls. Loop: the same call three times&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="231" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Restart&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Once, from the last commit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Restart once; a second failure goes up to the parent&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Attempt number and fence: output of an older attempt is refused&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Circuit breaker: two fresh failures in a row stop the wave&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="231" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Wake and resume&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;State is read again from files.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A wake is only a hint; two wake sources back each other up&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Resume two at a time; a session that disagrees with its branch stays parked&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="231" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Outside the tree&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;When everything stops.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Dead-man alert: fires if the whole tree goes quiet&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The machine: a copy off the machine, a restart chain, a sensor log, no sleep while working&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="231" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x11" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;strokeWidth=2;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="44" width="3300" height="277" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x12" value="HOW TO READ THIS" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=32;fontColor=#0f172a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="66" width="356.7" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x13" value="Start with the map on the left. Every box in it is one pipeline." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="126" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x14" value="Each pipeline is then drawn in full, under the same letter or number: a row of steps joined by arrows." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="159.8" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x15" value="Inside a step: one sentence on what it does, then the parts it is made of." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="193.5" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x16" value="The coloured line at the bottom of a step names the pipeline it feeds or uses." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="227.3" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x17" value="THE DOT ON EVERY PART" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0f172a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4530" y="126" width="281.5" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x18" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#16a34a;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="163.8" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x19" value="Built: it exists and has run, or passed its tests." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="159.8" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x20" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#f59e0b;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="195.3" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x21" value="Designed: worked out, not built yet." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="191.3" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x22" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#94a3b8;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="226.8" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x23" value="Idea: discussed, not designed yet." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="222.8" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x24" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#e11d48;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="258.3" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x25" value="Tested once, no gain yet: one form, on one repository. Not a verdict." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="254.3" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x26" value="WORDS" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0f172a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="126" width="94.2" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x27" value="Token: a piece of a word. Models read, write and are metered in tokens." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="159.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x28" value="Context window: everything the model reads on one call. It grows as a session goes on." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="188" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x29" value="Session: one run of a model with its own context window." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="216.3" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x30" value="Helper: a short-lived agent that a session starts for one job." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="244.5" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x31" value="Unit: one planned job for one session." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="272.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x32" value="Worktree: a separate copy of the repository on its own branch." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="159.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x33" value="Hook: a script the app runs before a tool call. It can refuse the call." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="188" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x34" value="Compaction: the app replaces a full window by a summary of it." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="216.3" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x35" value="The check: the full test suite a change must pass before it lands." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="244.5" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x36" value="Commit: one saved change in the history of the repository." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="272.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x37" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3494" y="397" width="3352" height="1673" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x38" value="KNOWLEDGE OF THE CODE" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="423" width="823.8" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x39" value="Three pipelines in a chain: the first builds a map of the code, the second learns from it, the third answers questions with it." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="494.5" width="1165.3" height="32.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#15803d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;BUILD THE CODE MAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Turn the repository into a graph of facts. Scripts do it; no model is asked.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#dff3e6;swimlaneFillColor=#dff3e6;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="546.8" width="1832" height="444.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-foot" value="Today: on one repository the typed store beat scripted search by 0.076 in answer recall; three storage engines gave identical answers; a popular outside graph tool scored lower (0.564 against 0.700). Not settled: which parser builds the facts." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="410" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;What is read.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Repository files at one commit: code, tests, settings, documents&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Git history: which files changed together, and when&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Extract facts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Scripts turn files into typed facts in about 5 seconds.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fact extractor: a script, no model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Links hidden in strings: a web route and its client call, a queue and its handler&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Document reader: sections by heading, each with a content hash&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Conclusion ledger: claim, evidence and source, so it can be rechecked&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The graph&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Things, and the typed links between them.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Nodes: files, definitions, tests, tables, settings, migrations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Edges: imports, calls, tests, cites, changed together&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Change sets: one node per commit joins its files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Time on every fact: true from one commit until another&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A renamed or moved definition keeps its identity&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Typed store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;All facts in one SQLite database, rebuilt for each working copy.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;One database of typed facts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Re-extract on change: rebuilt in seconds; nothing expires by age&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds A2 Train models · A3 Answer a question&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#15803d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;TRAIN MODELS ON THE GRAPH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Learn from past commits which files belong together. Runs on the graphics card.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#dff3e6;swimlaneFillColor=#dff3e6;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="1075.5" width="2292" height="483.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-foot" value="Today: built and run once; the trained models added nothing in the one form tried, on one repository. That is one form, not a verdict. Not settled: whether another form helps." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="449" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Training set&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The graph as it stood at each past commit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Graph snapshots, one per past commit&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Train&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Hide a true link; learn to rank it above false ones.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Goal: predict links&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;On the graphics card: an RTX 5070 with 12 GB, in containers, network off&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The models&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Five kinds, from tried to idea.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Graph embeddings (RotatE, ComplEx, TransE): each node becomes a vector of 256 numbers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Graph neural encoder (CompGCN): a node also mixes in its neighbours&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Routed specialists: one small model per code area, and a router&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Text and code embeddings: search by meaning, not by word&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fine-tuned retriever: a small local model trained on our own lookups&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Honest scoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Rules that stop a result from fooling us.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tune, freeze, then score once on commits never seen&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Placebo arm: a random scorer goes through the same steps&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Simple floors to beat: same folder, changed together, plain search&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Link scores&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;For a start file: how likely each other file is linked to it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds A3 Answer a question (Rank)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#15803d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;ANSWER A QUESTION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;An agent asks. A few hundred tokens come back, instead of whole files.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#dff3e6;swimlaneFillColor=#dff3e6;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="1643.3" width="2752" height="400.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-foot" value="Today: in a replay the cache served 87.6 % of lookups with 0.0 % wrong answers. Not run yet: an agent using the layer while it works. Set aside after study: a graph database server, a graph written by a model, expiry by age." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="366" width="2700" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ask&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The agent pulls an answer when it needs one.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A question arrives: what does changing this file touch?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pulled, never pushed: one command; nothing stuffed into every prompt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Question forms: a fixed list of kinds of question, each with its measured quality&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cache check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Same question, same facts: the same answer, at once.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Answer cache&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drop only what changed: an answer goes only if a fact it read has changed&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Find and walk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;From the start nodes, follow typed links a few hops.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Find the start: by keyword or by path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Walk the graph, within a budget of links&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Three lists, fused into one.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Closeness: personalised PageRank from the start file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Changed together: how often, as a confidence&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learned score: the link scores of the models&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fuse: reciprocal rank fusion, the sum of 1 / (60 + rank)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pack and return&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Keep the best that fits the budget.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pack to a budget of about 8,000 tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The answer: a tool result of a few hundred tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ways agents use it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The same layer, at different moments.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Session-start brief: a short map of the area&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Touch list: the functions, callers, co-changed files and tests of a change&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Edit-time warning: a hook warns on a risky edit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The real test: an agent with this tool against one with plain search&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="2326" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x40" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3494" y="2146" width="3352" height="1889.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x41" value="MEMORY" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="2172" width="281.7" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x42" value="What earlier sessions learned, kept so that nobody solves the same problem twice." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="2243.5" width="799.7" height="32.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;FILE A SOLVED PROBLEM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Whoever solves a hard problem stores it, in a way that can be trusted later.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="2295.8" width="2292" height="338.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-foot" value="Today: a complete design, not built." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="304" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Record&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A fixed form: symptom, cause, fix, dead ends.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prove it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The entry carries a check that shows the cause is really there.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Control pair: the check fires on the known-bad commit and stays quiet on the known-good one&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Write gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Nothing unsafe or duplicated gets in.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Scrubs secrets; refuses duplicates&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Asks: was this stored already, but not found?&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A reviewer who is not the author tries to refute it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reviewer confirms: a strong model, never the author&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Append-only files are the truth; a search index is rebuilt from them.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Journal and index (SQLite)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds B2 Look up before solving&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;LOOK UP BEFORE SOLVING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Before spending tokens on a problem, ask whether it was solved before.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="2718.5" width="1832" height="358.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-foot" value="Today: a complete design, not built. Not settled: whether the library grows into this store or stays beside it." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="324" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;When to look&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;At the moments where repeating work costs most.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Before a stronger model, before a retry, before applying a suggested fix&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lookup on a diff: warns when a change touches something an entry protects&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Match&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Find the stored entry for this error.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lookup: the error text is masked into a stable template and matched&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead, candidate or miss; never a guess&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verify gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The entry's own check runs on today's code. The fix is shown only if the cause is present.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Verify before use&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Do-not-apply entries: warnings that a tempting fix is wrong here&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Keep it true&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;An entry is rechecked when the code under it changes.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Suspect on change: marked, then its check runs again&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 1 PLAN · 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;LIBRARY OF RULINGS AND FACTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;The project's own record of what was decided, measured and got wrong.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="3161.3" width="1832" height="362.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-foot" value="Today: built and in daily use." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="328" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Record&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A claim plus how it is known: measured, quoted from a paper, reasoned, or the owner's ruling.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Journal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One line per record. Lines are only added, never changed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Correction: a new record replaces a wrong one; the top session decides&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Board&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One page: before you do X, look up Y. Also the open tasks and the known gaps.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lookup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;By id or by word. Nothing found means &amp;quot;not recorded&amp;quot;, never a guess.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Recall test: a fresh session answers from the library alone&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 1 PLAN (every session start)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;STANDING NOTES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;What every session is given before it starts.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5448" y="3161.3" width="1372" height="362.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-foot" value="Today: built and in daily use." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="328" width="1320" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Instruction file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A short root map every session loads. Detail sits in files that load only where needed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Skills: packaged how-tos, loaded only when a task needs them&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;What must survive a hand-over.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Memory index: one line per lasting note; a note is opened only when needed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Notes file: written before a hand-over, read back after it&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Keep it small&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Every call reads the standing text again.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Small standing context&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Keep the prompt cache: add at the end, never at the top&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 1 PLAN (every session start)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;REASONING CACHE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Let a cheap model reuse what a strong model already worked out.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="3608" width="1832" height="401.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-foot" value="Today: modelled only. Not settled: whether reuse beats the plain ladder; how partial solutions would be joined." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="367" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cheap model first&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A small model tries, using a stored solution if one fits.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Climb the ladder&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;If it fails, the problem climbs: Haiku, Sonnet, Opus, Fable.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Store the solution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;What the strong model worked out is kept for next time.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stored for the cheap model to reuse&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Join partial solutions: pieces of several stored solutions, joined through the graph&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Count the reuse&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Does reuse really beat the plain ladder?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reuse funnel: seven stages a reused answer must survive, each counted&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tests before building: would a perfect lookup have matched? how much is covered? how often is work sent back?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 2 ADMIT (Pick the model)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x43" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3494" y="4111.8" width="3352" height="723.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x44" value="HOW IT GETS BETTER" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="4137.8" width="658.5" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x45" value="One pipeline that turns what was measured into better rules." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="4209.3" width="585.5" height="32.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#be185d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;G&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;MEASURE AND IMPROVE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;The harness studies itself and changes its own rules.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#fbdcea;swimlaneFillColor=#fbdcea;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="4261.5" width="2292" height="547.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-foot" value="Round 3 of the research: four lanes, 361 claims, each through a script gate and a blind refuter. Not done: the pilot, one real task run as a tree against a single session." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="26" y="513" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Measure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Everything is judged by the same seven measures.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Seven measures: throughput, efficiency, token count, token cost, time taken, quality, hallucinations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Token tally: every transcript counted, per session and per unit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Machine recorder: memory, processor, the queue of the check&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Investigate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Experts first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Questions frozen before any reading starts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cheap collectors: facts and quotes, no judgment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong analysts: each claim with its source and what would prove it wrong&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Reviews second.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Citation check: every quote exists where it is claimed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Blind refuter: sees only claim and evidence&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Three buckets: verified, open risk, refuted; the top session decides&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Borrow a solved design; do not invent one.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Borrow solved designs: name the classical problem first&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Seven borrowed designs: master and workers, append-only storage, a trusted checker, systematic review, planted faults, B-trees, hazard analysis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Model check: the rules run as a state machine with faults injected&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Outside practice: 24 adopted and 54 to trial, of 861 ideas read&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Eight research lanes: tokens, graphs, learned encoders, memory and time, logic with learning, local models, orchestration, measurement&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;One null is not a verdict&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prove before rollout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The cheapest proof first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Replay before live: over recorded sessions, at no model cost&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Dry run with stand-ins: fake agents test the plumbing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;One live trial, with the scoring fixed beforehand, against a control&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds B3 Library · 1 PLAN (better rules)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
